Baselines. We selected two key baselines for
comparison. First, GPT-4o (OpenAI, 2023) represents the most capable LLMs, providing an upper
bound on LLM performance. Second, DeepSeekCoder (Guo et al., 2024) is selected as the current SOTA open-source Code LLM. It represents
the forefront of publicly available models specifically tailored for coding tasks. While recent work
