and return value more accurate. With this context, we first measure targeted correctness: whether functions, types, and structs are
recovered accurately according to the following metrics:
• Function recovery: matched to source first by exact name,
then by a coarse signature fingerprint matching of argument count and per-argument type class
• Return type: match after normalization that resolves aliases
