C structure declarations. The benchmark programs, mutation
strategies, and decompilation results presented herein do not
include consideration of C structures. We believe generalizing
our technique to support mutations of structure declarations
is a matter of additional effort, but does not fundamentally
affect the implementation or the performance of the BED
