Decompiling x86 Deep Neural Network Executables
Zhibo Liu, Yuanyuan Yuan, Shuai Wang∗
The Hong Kong University of Science and Technology
{zliudc,yyuanaq,shuaiw}@cse.ust.hk

Xiaofei Xie
Singapore Management University
xfxie@smu.edu.sg

