Design

Decompiling DNN executables is challenging due to the mismatch between instruction-level semantics and high-level
model specifications. DNN executables lack high-level information regarding operators, topologies, and dimensions.
Therefore, decompiling DNN executables presents numerous
reverse engineering hurdles, as it is difficult to deduce high-

